        "Beloved, I will not ask you to pray for an hour tomorrow. I will ask for something smaller and harder: begin. Tomorrow, before you look at your phone, sit up and say the first word, Father. Then tell Him honestly what is on your heart, pray one line of the prayer Jesus taught, and lift one person you love before His throne by name. That is enough for the first day. Do it again the next day, and the day after that.",
